ligolo-proxy
Usage: ligolo-proxy -selfcert

The operator side of ligolo-ng: it stands up a tun-based tunnel so the network
behind a foothold appears as a local interface you can reach directly, no socks
juggling. Run this on YOUR box; run `ligolo-agent` on the foothold.

	-selfcert     generate a self-signed cert (lab / quick use)
	in its shell: `session` to pick an agent, then `start`

For authorised engagements only.

See also: ligolo-agent, chisel, socat
